      "post_datetime": "2005-05-08T01:25:00+00:00",
      "post_subject": "model building for holography",
      "content_md": "I've also used un-baked sculpy without a problem.\n\n The fish- bink hologram on my gallery used un-baked sculpy for the foot &fish .\n\n[http://www.dragonseye.com/holography/gallery.html](http://www.dragonseye.com/holography/gallery.html)\n\nThe Fish was supported with floral wire.",
