      "post_subject": "model building for holography",
      "content_md": "i have tried additonal support , trying to produce a DCG master using the 315 laser, @ a seven min exp. maybe the best way to do this, is to use a SH master then shoot the H2 in dichromate, remember im dealing with only 100 mw of 532nm ,the film requires 200Mj/cm.",
