      "post_subject": "model building for holography",
      "content_md": "> **dave battin:** remember im dealing with only 100 mw of 532nm ,the film requires 200Mj/cm.\n\n200 Mega Joules?!! Talk about insensitive emulsion!! \n\nYou probably will be better off making the master on silver. My exposure was only about 10 seconds.",
